      "id": "T-RENDERER",
      "title": "Task rows and diagnosis parsing",
      "objective": "Implement format_task_row, parse_diagnosis, and render_table in src/boardscan.py. \n\n1. format_task_row: \n   - Columns: [id, title, status, retry_count, dependencies], joined by ' | '.\n   - Status: use verbatim for 'done', 'pending', 'failed'; otherwise use '?'.\n   - Sanitization: Replace all newline-like characters (\\n, \\r, and \\v) in 'id' and 'title' with a single space.\n   - ATTEMPTS: Use 'retry_count' (default 0).\n   - DEPS: Join dependencies list with ', ' or use '-' if empty/missing.\n\n2. parse_diagnosis: \n   - Strictly match strings STARTING with 'DIAGNOSIS: <cause> (confidence=<confidence>) remedy=<remedy>'.\n   - Return {'cause': <cause>, 'confidence': <confidence>, 'remedy': <remedy>} or None.\n\n3. render_table: \n   - Input: output from load_projects (list of (name, data/exception) tuples).\n   - Skip (name, exception) tuples.\n   - Format: '== <name> ==', followed by one formatted task row per task, followed by any parsed diagnosis lines indented by two spaces.\n   - Join all lines with '\\n' without a trailing newline.",
